{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50211","headline":"□镜（斯五五五下同）（题中缺字，项云据首句看，应是「览」字。） · 侯休祥","name":"□镜（斯五五五下同）（题中缺字，项云据首句看，应是「览」字。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽览今朝镜，殊非李（昔）[一]是容。\n（「李」，原卷作「昔」。\n）自看由（犹）□识，何况故人逢？\n（[一]余疑「李」爲「昔」字之误，俞云：「昔日固是，但李字与昔音形均无关系，似只可存疑，或前旧均有可能。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"侯休祥","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50211.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50211","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}